        "is_free": false,
        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.☆.｡+:ﾟ+｡.ﾟ･.☆.:・°.･ﾟ　.ﾟ･.☆｡・°.･ﾟﾟ･.☆.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pastel☆Parade is an exhilarating rhythm game with easy controls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a comfortable rhythm to the cute and poppy music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are very intuitive: just press the buttons with the right timing according to the song's beat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >//////////////////////////////////////////////////////</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎵 30 groovy original songs!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy Pastel☆Parade's catchy, cute, and unique songs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of them can be quite challenging! Each play session only lasts about a minute, so you can try your hand at the songs as many times as you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌟 Fun gameplay! Four bright, poppy characters!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your rhythm influences how the characters in the game move! Their animations are lots of fun whether you can keep the beat or not!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself to a rhythm adventure with them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📖 A little story too...?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game, its story is revealed little by little.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is divided into four areas, each with a different atmosphere. How far can you go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >//////////////////////////////////////////////////////</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join this fun parade with its cute characters! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685840/extras/f04a9455a7bd17ca0c00b64fde2191d4.avif?t=1759159577\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.☆.｡+:ﾟ+｡.ﾟ･.☆.:・°.･ﾟ　.ﾟ･.☆｡・°.･ﾟﾟ･.☆. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Director / Programming - matsufriends </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art / Scenario - bone </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound - FALL, MasaDo, Tsuyomi, MiwoTsukushi, Akane Aomo, AMANUMA Takayuki, YMAC </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Programming - Seaeees, Yagi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming Permissions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game allows live streaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For more details, please refer to the news post: “Guidelines for Streaming and Sharing Gameplay of Pastel☆Parade”</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.☆.｡+:ﾟ+｡.ﾟ･.☆.:・°.･ﾟ　.ﾟ･.☆｡・°.･ﾟﾟ･.☆.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pastel☆Parade is an exhilarating rhythm game with easy controls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a comfortable rhythm to the cute and poppy music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are very intuitive: just press the buttons with the right timing according to the song's beat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >//////////////////////////////////////////////////////</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎵 30 groovy original songs!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy Pastel☆Parade's catchy, cute, and unique songs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of them can be quite challenging! Each play session only lasts about a minute, so you can try your hand at the songs as many times as you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌟 Fun gameplay! Four bright, poppy characters!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your rhythm influences how the characters in the game move! Their animations are lots of fun whether you can keep the beat or not!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself to a rhythm adventure with them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📖 A little story too...?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game, its story is revealed little by little.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is divided into four areas, each with a different atmosphere. How far can you go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >//////////////////////////////////////////////////////</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join this fun parade with its cute characters! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685840/extras/f04a9455a7bd17ca0c00b64fde2191d4.avif?t=1759159577\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.☆.｡+:ﾟ+｡.ﾟ･.☆.:・°.･ﾟ　.ﾟ･.☆｡・°.･ﾟﾟ･.☆. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Director / Programming - matsufriends </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art / Scenario - bone </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound - FALL, MasaDo, Tsuyomi, MiwoTsukushi, Akane Aomo, AMANUMA Takayuki, YMAC </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Programming - Seaeees, Yagi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming Permissions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game allows live streaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For more details, please refer to the news post: “Guidelines for Streaming and Sharing Gameplay of Pastel☆Parade”</p>",
